      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ryan%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area encompassing present-day Ryan was originally part of Pickens County in the Chickasaw Nation within Indian Territory.",
